95","characterName":"神森 櫻乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20763","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"6681"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26648"],"vndbCharacterId":"c58895"},"originalCharacterName":"神森 櫻乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔から病弱で、ここ数ヶ月入退院を繰り返していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の寿命が残り少ないことも、兄である主人公が医者からそのことを告げられたこともなんとなく気付いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや天然だが、健気で良い子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘えん坊だが、相手を困らせるような無理はいわない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間知らずだが、頭が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公ほど才能はないが、ピアノが弾ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むしろ歌を歌うことが好きで、自分の書いた曲を兄に演奏してもらい、自分が歌う、そんな演奏会を夢見ている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26648","sourceWorkId":"4965","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"CV：榊原ゆい"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公的妹妹(义妹)。坚强且爱撒娇，可是自己希望想要得到的东西及想做的事都总是不常开口要求。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外表上看得出是个不知世故、头脑也很聪明的孩子。比起如柳太朗般的弹钢琴的才能，到不如说她比较喜欢唱歌这方面。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"梦想有一天能为哥哥编曲，两人一起在演奏会上合奏。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可是也开始注意到了自己剩下的寿命的事。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20763"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59c55e61b0f2a0e2aecc853ba0d37f4ccd80acf967ae2b28454ddd0f99feeeb5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/eccb508ece5fafbd62c9f11c7d681a776344254a31e8382041c38586d194c58a.webp","width":196,"height":240,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榊原ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s272","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s272","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s272","name":"榊原 ゆい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:6681:20763:4916:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c58896","characterName":"木花","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20764","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"6681"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26649"],"vndbCharacterId":"c58896"},"originalCharacterName":"木花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公らが訪れた館（＝サナトリウム）の唯一の住人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メイドとナースを兼ねており、主人公らの面倒を見てくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔の記憶を部分的に失っていることから、自分の名前も覚えていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天然っぽいが、ドジはほとんどなく、仕事に関しては完ぺきな上に料理も絶品。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"館には一匹の黒猫がおり、彼女はその猫を「ご主人様」と呼んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その黒猫は、どこかふてぶてしく、異様な迫力がある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26649","sourceWorkId":"4965","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"CV：榊原ゆい"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"住在诊疗所的护士兼女仆。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"看起来文静的性格，工作和全部家事都能准确且完美的处理。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"制作带有异样的味道的药汤是她唯一的问题点。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"已经失去了过去一部分的记忆，本名不详。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20764"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ffd30a1e4c7cb3054c96f4d7cb88ed38a462d27e448e66185ace32cb4f3b1207.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/317790cf784e9362c8455c0c0efd798a637c599e90e5ff6ae712957c6469bed5.webp","width":239,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榊原ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s272","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s272","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s272","name":"榊原 ゆい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:6681:20764:4916:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c61386","characterName":"メフィ","sourceIds":{"vndbC